      clinicalImportance: 'OCT has revolutionized the diagnosis and management of retinal diseases, including age-related macular degeneration, diabetic macular edema, glaucoma, and macular holes. It provides quantitative measurements of retinal thickness, nerve fiber layer thickness, and volumetric data, enabling early detection, treatment planning, and monitoring of disease progression and treatment response.',
